exports[`email > latency, many endpoints, no dashboard link: text and HTML bodies > text 1`] = `
"Incident opened: Acme Cards: 7 endpoints slow

Duration: 6 min (since 10:20 UTC)
Environment: production

- GET /v2/thing0/:id: errors 0% (normal 0%), p95 4.1 s (normal 300 ms)
- GET /v2/thing1/:id: errors 0% (normal 0%), p95 4.1 s (normal 300 ms)
- GET /v2/thing2/:id: errors 0% (normal 0%), p95 4.1 s (normal 300 ms)
- GET /v2/thing3/:id: errors 0% (normal 0%), p95 4.1 s (normal 300 ms)
- GET /v2/thing4/:id: errors 0% (normal 0%), p95 4.1 s (normal 300 ms)
- …and 2 more endpoints
Other Acme Cards endpoints: also degraded (GET /v2/cards).

Summary for the provider (paste as is):
Acme Cards — POST /v2/cards/:id/activate failing since 10:20 UTC (6 min)
Error rate 38% (normal 0.2%), 200 calls in window. Outcomes: 5xx 100%.
p95 latency 2.5 s (normal 181 ms). Other Acme Cards endpoints: OK.
Sample provider request IDs: req_fail_20_0, req_fail_20_1, req_fail_21_0
Support: support@acmecards.test

-- Theirside"
`;

